<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header centered"><span class="eyebrow">Lanterns Left Behind</span><h1>Carry With Me</h1><p>Anonymous, asynchronous and deliberately slow. No likes. No followers. No replies. No DMs.</p></div>
  <div class="lantern-field"><% lanterns.forEach((l,i)=>{ %><article class="community-lantern lantern-pos-<%= i%6 %>"><div class="mini-flame">✦</div><p><%= l.content %></p><small><%= l.theme %> · <%= l.pod %></small></article><% }) %><% if(!lanterns.length){ %><div class="empty-state light-empty"><h2>The field is quiet.</h2><p>No approved lanterns match this view yet.</p></div><% } %></div>
  <div class="community-controls"><form method="get" action="/community" class="filter-form"><select name="theme"><option value="">All themes</option><% ['grief','burnout','anxiety','chronic illness','identity','general'].forEach(x=>{ %><option <%= filters.theme===x?'selected':'' %>><%= x %></option><% }) %></select><input name="pod" value="<%= filters.pod %>" placeholder="Pod e.g. Zimbabwe"><button class="button button-ghost button-sm">Filter</button></form><form method="post" action="/community" class="card leave-lantern"><span class="eyebrow">Leave a lantern</span><textarea name="content" rows="4" maxlength="1200" required placeholder="Something true enough to leave behind…"></textarea><div class="form-grid two"><select name="theme"><option>general</option><option>grief</option><option>burnout</option><option>anxiety</option><option>chronic illness</option><option>identity</option></select><input name="pod" value="global" placeholder="Cultural / regional pod"></div><button class="button">Send to care review</button><small>Every lantern passes moderation before it can appear.</small></form></div>
</section>
